OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain dry this evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith clear skies. Temperatures fall
OL,8,Faway to leave a cold night and a
OL,9,Fwidespread frost with a few mist and
OL,10,Ffreezing fog patches forming.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAfter any mist clears,
OL,13,FThursday will be dry with plenty of
OL,14,Fautumnal sunshine. Feeling cold for
OL,15,Fthe time of year with a breeze towards
OL,16,FPembrokeshire and a widespread frost
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
